Nineteen encounters from level 1 to level 20. Each leads with the concept it is built around, then gives its terrain and its roster. In this book the terrain is usually the encounter — most of these creatures cannot chase, and the fight only exists because of where it happens.

XP totals are raw sums for budgeting against the 2024 encounter tables. They assume a party of four to five.

